<p data-part="paragraph">[x] miles, marked. A map is in your unit. Phone signal cuts out in parts of the valley, so tell someone at the Hearth which way you are going.</p>
<p data-part="paragraph">Birds are the reason most people are quiet out there. [x] species have been recorded on the property. There is a list in the room and binoculars at the Hearth.</p>
